{"translation":{"id":"fra_jnd","name":"Bible J.N. Darby","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=frajnd","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=frajnd","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"JND","englishName":"French: Bible J.N. Darby","language":"fra","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"121a3f4841e42965f22ebebcf5a8578a12578ec30eaf1ca7ae4e46d5d85ccb80","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/fra_jnd/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31170,"languageName":"français","languageEnglishName":"French"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"fra_jnd","name":"Les Psaumes","commonName":"Les Psaumes","title":"Les Psaumes","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"4c48a766d24644f7ef347ae1395ef8ddb5d363cc30acf1733162d22f071b120e","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/fra_jnd/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/fra_jnd/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2527},"chapter":{"number":61,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"Au chef de musique. Sur Neguinoth","poem":1},{"noteId":171},{"text":". De David.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"Ô Dieu ! écoute mon cri, sois attentif à ma prière.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Du bout de la terre je crierai à toi, dans l’accablement de mon cœur ; tu me conduiras sur un rocher qui est trop haut pour moi","poem":1},{"noteId":172},{"text":".","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Car tu m’as été un refuge, une forte tour, de devant l’ennemi.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Je séjournerai dans ta tente à toujours ; je me réfugierai sous l’abri de tes ailes. Sélah.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Car toi, ô Dieu ! tu as entendu mes vœux, tu m’as donné l’héritage de ceux qui craignent ton nom.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Tu ajouteras des jours aux jours du roi ; ses années seront comme des générations et des générations.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Il habitera pour toujours devant Dieu. Donne la bonté et la vérité, afin qu’elles le gardent.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Ainsi je chanterai ton nom à perpétuité, acquittant mes vœux jour par jour.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":171,"caller":"a","text":"instruments à cordes.","reference":{"chapter":61,"verse":1}},{"noteId":172,"caller":"b","text":"ou : plus haut que moi.","reference":{"chapter":61,"verse":3}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/fra_jnd/PSA/61.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/fra_jnd/PSA/62.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/fra_jnd/PSA/60.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":9}